\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TayP2KhkrmMQ7kNvwF_zrxs&_nc_oc=AdqSKBdfB5LDc31PXXIWKuvpKW5n_Q7INAeCAOajM24ODhE9H539dY43HSWrqU8ByRI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ1P_wmBf1IK6Ju77b6F_TzMp0a7msNL0g1fBJqFf5zEw&oe=6B0C5AF6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x0d0zVHShCcQ7kNvwHDwDc6&_nc_oc=AdoY1oFaw5HO_XGKjplNyP0YloFMdnav58PXrJKKA8vx7t5E5IFa7kXsdAafG9Rs-N4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS6pG8ZOglJBMPupLPj6MCK8f2rr30Ej5zyz8nNFRd7lA&oe=6B0C56F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8eLBv08fOlkQ7kNvwGMdqrv&_nc_oc=AdrqiN7QeJn94tq0y7csQI7p4-iqAqB1lNlBKjfDrE612aA8A1jCE07QD9s7x0uhC_o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSMEbZkpy9wKkPsR0_WuJswe6bJAoMGBoZKrfi8wFmqEQ&oe=6B0C5B7E"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u